Changes to exlaunch:
- Makefile: output to deploy/totk-mouse/exefs as subsdk8 (TOTK Optimizer uses subsdk9).
- config.mk: target title 0100F2C0115B6000.
- misc/scripts/post-build.sh: main.npdm is not shipped, it would replace the game's.
- misc/mk/common.mk: source folders are sorted, so builds do not depend on the
  filesystem's directory order.
- source/program/main.cpp: replaced the example with the TOTK mouse camera mod.

